# voxpane push-to-talk — toggle recording on/off.
# Suggested bind: SUPER + ALT + V
#
# `voxpane install-bindings` writes the right form for your Omarchy/Hyprland
# version and re-applies it idempotently. Omarchy updates can overwrite
# ~/.config/hypr/bindings.conf (upstream #1802), so this snippet is the tracked
# source of truth — re-run install-bindings after an update.
#
# Binding format varies by version: newer Omarchy builds use bindings.lua with an
# o.bind(...) helper; older ones bindings.conf with `bindd = ...`.
# install-bindings detects which exists and matches the surrounding syntax.

# --- Hyprland / Omarchy bindings.conf form ---
# bindd = MODS, key, description, dispatcher, args
bindd = SUPER ALT, V, Toggle voxpane dictation, exec, voxpane toggle

# --- Omarchy bindings.lua form (newer builds) ---
# o.bind("SUPER ALT", "V", "exec, voxpane toggle", { description = "Toggle voxpane dictation" })
